/*
  AIVoiceMode.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0059 · AIVoiceMode (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `AIVoiceMode`
  resolves (table "AIVoiceMode") lives here with its web English value. These entries fold into the
  app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface
  table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the parity set extracted from the web source
  (web/src/components/ai/AIVoiceMode.tsx + the shared AIFeatureCard / AiOutputPanel /
  AIThinkingIndicator literals it composes). The second group backs the native P4 leaf chrome (the
  freshness / connectivity / loading / error copy) so the Swift sources hold no English prose.
*/

